# demo-vmv.pages.dev is a duplicate host: it serves a full copy of every near-me
# page while the real page lives on <slug>.pages.dev. GSC records the duplicate
# as the declared canonical on atmsnearme and petrolpumpsnearme.
#
# These rules 301 every duplicated path to the real host, so link equity and
# any traffic that still lands here reaches the site that should rank.
#
# Order matters: Cloudflare Pages takes the first matching rule.

# root -> the network sitemap index (an HTML index of every site)
/  https://sitemaps.india-in.workers.dev/  301

# sitemap / robots must not compete with the real hosts
/sitemap.xml  https://sitemaps.india-in.workers.dev/sitemap-index.xml  301
/robots.txt  https://sitemaps.india-in.workers.dev/robots.txt  301

